    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>When you take a Magic action to remove the button from this cloak’s hood, its fabric starts unraveling behind you wherever you go, leaving an unbroken thread. Other creatures can see the thread only if they take the Search action to look for it and succeed on a DC 15 Wisdom (Perception) check.</p><p>The cloak stops unraveling after 100 miles or when you take a Magic action to button it again. If you teleport while it is unraveling, any thread already unraveled is destroyed at once.</p>",
